// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P231382797" "Keep an eye out for Arachnos patrols."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3693267671" "I think we can do some work here later."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2886989505" "This place is nice and quiet.  We'll bring the shipments through later."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2648950939" "Got it.  They said to keep an eye out for Arachnos and Warriors."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P26886287" "Tsoo!  Let's go!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3169704912" "Whatever kind of villain you think you are?  You're not!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P895327531" "Heroes give us a better run for the money!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1607205371" "You will not stand in our way, meat!"

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3268450384" "A Warrior doesn't roll over for anyone.  Least of all Tsoo!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P433003974" "Do...your...worst."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3484758258" "I'm not afraid of you."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3563826164" "This isn't over."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P964432109" "This is far from over."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P637740031" "Thanks for the distraction, meat!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4276408214" "No honor among thieves!  Let's do this!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4203646745" "More opponents, more fun, I say!"

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3118143641" "That was a mistake interrupting me, rogue!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2242202943" "An unwise choice for which you will pay dearly, rogue!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_SHAKEDOWN_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4146490210" "You should learn not to interrupt.  Very rude.  Very dangerous."

// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_KNIFEFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2313593928" "Good dodge!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_KNIFEFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2344823398" "You must anticipate!  Excellent!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_KNIFEFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3915373622" "Avoid the blade; be nimble!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_KNIFEFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3420334717" "Your reflexes are improving."
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_KNIFEFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P853584913" "The knife cannot hurt you if it cannot touch you!"

// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_KNIFEFIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P751871905" "And now we have a new opponent!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_KNIFEFIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2153126928" "Think yourself a villain?  Let's test you!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_KNIFEFIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P288714068" "No more Mr. Nice Tsoo.  This one's for blood, rogue!"

// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1039767835" "Maintain your stance!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1673514330" "Don't over-extend your arm."
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1914169000" "Grace and skill, hone them both!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3400023708" "Very good.  You're learning."
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3635747027" "You are a true swordsman."

// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3541111677" "Lesson's over.  Now on to the final exam!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2091068600" "Get the rogues!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1967721445" "Any means necessary, Tsoo.  Teach them respect!"
// SIRENSCALL_SPAR_SWORDFIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3062804954" "Class is over.  Homework is to take down as many of these rogues as possible!"

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P670090606" "It's good stuff.  You'll want in on this one."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P895256158" "I have a larger shipment coming in later today, too."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2728886674" "I can sell in bulk, if that's what you need."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4291297729" "For the right price, I can get you almost anything."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P212240083" "Bad move, rogue."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P138639040" "Dumb move."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P438673119" "No witnesses!"

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2882911945" "I heard you had some good stuff."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4116337741" "What you got?"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2600577389" "I need a lot and I need it yesterday."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2244889342" "My partners will only buy the best."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1376179400" "If the price is right, I think we can make this work."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2106739443" "No witnesses!  No one can know we're working together!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2359999136" "A real villain would have known when to keep walking!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_TRAFFIK_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2718051660" "There's smart villains and then there's you.  Let me smack some sense into you!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_CHATTING_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3912913231" "They're all fools."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CHATTING_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4117546854" "St. Martial is ripe for the picking."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CHATTING_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2780546951" "Arachnos has had its time.  It is our time now.  Patience."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CHATTING_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4041487530" "All in due time.  All in due time."

// STM_ALLHOODS_CHATTING_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3970493867" "You die now!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_CHATTING_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3466959056" "The enormity of this mistake will not hit you until it is far too late."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CHATTING_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3922889634" "They will have to use dental records to identify you."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CHATTING_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P988508546" "I have ways of killing you that do not even leave a mark."

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3342211310" "We are destined for greatness here in St. Martial.  I sense it."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3636325875" "Our time is at hand.  I sense it."

// STM_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3922966000" "Our time is now.  We must proceed carefully.   There are many who would see us fail."
// STM_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1206739159" "No distractions this time.  We pick our moment.  We attack."
// STM_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2651505382" "Tonight, we begin the plan."

// STM_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2804791714" "Quiet.  I hear something.  You!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2442804422" "Did you hear that?  You!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3404435140" "You!"

